# Trust 100% Sustainment Protocol

The Trust Enforcer reports `N/N TRUSTED (100%) — Pre-flight 5/5 — GREEN — 0 actions` three times daily (5:10 AM, 5:10 PM, 11:10 PM UTC), where N is the sum of `trust_baseline` expected counts for all registered auditors. Any change that drops this below 100% is a regression.

